[en.FOCUS_C11_RETALIATION]
Total Retaliation

[en.FOCUS_C11_RETALIATION_desc]
In the spring of the year 1000, the Queen Chrysalis, who returned victorious in the Ultimate Battle, ordered the changelings to return to their original forms and launched a large-scale retaliation within the changeling community. In this action, the leader Thorax became the first changeling to be publicly hanged in front of the hive.\nHowever, a solid rule is not possible to maintain only through fear and killing. Queen Chrysalis naturally understands this, and she truly believes that changelings will have a better life under her reign.\nTherefore, Queen Chrysalis promised to the changelings who returned to their original forms: by “plundering” the love of other races instead of “sharing”, changelings will get far more love than they used to.\nAt the same time, Queen Chrysalis turned her spearhead to the ponies: for a long time, the ponies have been the dominant race over the entire Equestria world. Now, Queen Chrysalis declared to the world that changelings are the true master race. Changelings will use their sharp teeth and claws to fight for their lebensraum.\n“Changelings Master Race!” This rousing slogan successfully persuaded most of the changelings who were otherwise still skeptical and fearful. In the autumn of the year 1000, all the dissenters among the changelings had been arrested, exiled, or physically eliminated. To fulfill her promise, Queen Chrysalis led the reorganized changeling army on a conquering expedition to the Crystal Empire.

[zh.FOCUS_C11_RETALIATION]
彻底清算

[zh.FOCUS_C11_RETALIATION_desc]
1000年春，在终末之战中得胜归来的邪茧女王，命令幻形灵们重新回归原有的形态，并在幻形灵内部发动了大规模的清算行动。在这场行动中，首领索拉克斯首当其冲，成为了第一只被在虫巢公开吊死的幻形灵。\n然而，牢固的统治并不可能只通过恐惧和杀戮就可以维持，邪茧女王自然是懂得这一点的，而她也真心相信在自己的统治下，幻形灵们会得到更好的生活。\n因此，邪茧女王向回归原有形态的幻形灵们承诺：通过“掠夺”其他种族的爱意，幻形灵们将得到远多于通过“分享”而得来的爱意。\n与此同时，邪茧女王将矛头对准了小马们：长久以来，小马种族才是整个小马利亚世界的核心种族，而如今，邪茧女王向天下宣告，幻形灵种族才是上等种族，他们将用利牙和利爪，夺取生存空间！\n“幻形灵才是上等种族！”这一响亮的口号，成功的说服了大部分还保持着疑虑和恐惧的幻形灵们。1000年秋，幻形灵内部的异见者已经被悉数逮捕、放逐或物理消灭，为了兑现承诺，邪茧女王率领经过清算后重组的幻形灵军队，踏上了对水晶帝国的远征之路。

